# lf colors file — whitespace-separated  <pattern>  <ansi-code>  pairs.
# Matching order (most specific first): Full Path > Dir Name (trailing /) >
# File Type > File Name > Base Name > Extension > Default.
# Full-path patterns expand ~ and win over everything, so they're the way to
# tint specific directories regardless of their name.

